@startuml
title Activity 21 - Feedback Submission

|User|
start
:Open Settings > Feedback;
:Choose feedback type and rating;
:Enter message and optional attachment;
:Click Submit;
|Frontend|
:Validate type, rating and message;
if (Input valid?) then (yes)
  :POST /api/feedback;
|Backend|
:Authenticate user;
:Persist feedback record;
:Create Admin notification;
|Frontend|
:Show feedback submitted;
stop
else (no)
:Show validation errors;
stop
endif
@enduml
